- `apps/mercato/src/modules/insurance_desk/components/policies/LinkedLeadPreviewCard.tsx` (open inquiry)
- `packages/core/src/modules/resources/components/detail/ResourceLinkedPoliciesSection.tsx` (open policy)
- `packages/core/src/modules/resources/components/detail/VehicleAccessoriesSection.tsx` (open linked accessory resource)
- `packages/core/src/modules/resources/components/ResourceCustomerLinkField.tsx` (open person / company from selected link preview)
- `apps/mercato/src/modules/insurance_desk/components/policies/PolicyCustomerInlineSection.tsx` (`PolicyCustomerDetailPreview` — company + person tiles, each with Open)

## Imports (typical)

```tsx
import Link from 'next/link'
import { ExternalLink } from 'lucide-react'
import { Button } from '@open-mercato/ui/primitives/button'
```

